<title>USA: USA Detergents postpones annual meeting.</title>
<headline>USA Detergents postpones annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USA Detergents Inc said Monday that it has postponed its Annual Meeting which was scheduled to be held August 13th.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to reschedule the meeting for some time in the fall.  </p>
<p>USA Detergents, which manufactures laundry and household cleaning products, did not disclose a reason for the postponement.</p>
